{"id":"en_miss-quinn-s-multiple-veils","title":"Miss Quinn's Multiple Veils","titleEn":"Miss Quinn's Multiple Veils","description":"Abandoned by her biological father, a clever and formidable young woman comes back to visit her mother's grave one last time—and in the process rescues a mysterious man from an ambush. Once she returns home, her family takes her for a naive country bumpkin and looks down on her, going so far as to hand her fiancé to someone else. She secretly takes a position at a large corporation, where she contends with envious rivals and crosses paths again with the man she saved. As buried secrets come to light, the pair discover that their destinies are closely bound together. Miss Quinn's Multiple Veils can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/miss-quinns-multiple-veils/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/miss-quinns-multiple-veils/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Secret Identity","Scumbag-punishing","One Night Stand","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds0uw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_miss-quinn-s-multiple-veils_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds0uw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_miss-quinn-s-multiple-veils_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds0uw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_miss-quinn-s-multiple-veils_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds0uw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_miss-quinn-s-multiple-veils_4","title"